{"id":"dolozhit_","lemma":"доложить","pos":"verb","rank":3389,"glosses":["to report, to announce (to notify formally)","to add more, to put more (e.g. into a portion)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"доложу","2s":"доложишь","3s":"доложит","1p":"доложим","2p":"доложите","3p":"доложат"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"доложи","2p":"доложите"}}},"past":{"m":"доложил","p":"доложили","f":"доложила","n":"доложило"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"докладывать","examples":[{"text":"Том доложил, что всё в порядке.","en":"Tom reported that everything was in order.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"what / that"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,6,"no worries"]]},{"text":"Мне сказали доложить вам.","en":"I was told to report to you.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Ты доложил о произошедшем?","en":"Did you report what happened?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"about"},null]},{"text":"Я должен доложить об этом Тому.","en":"I must report this to Tom.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must, have to"},null,{"g":"about"},null,{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"}]},{"text":"Я кратко доложил начальнику о новом проекте.","en":"I briefed my boss on the new project.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"briefly"},null,null,{"g":"about"},null,null]}]}